    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<div>教科書：自編教材</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>參考書： 1. 李錫霖、陳炳煌，&rdquo;鋼筋混凝土學&rdquo;，五南圖書公司，第二版。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. 中國土木工程學會混凝土工程委員會，&rdquo;鋼筋混凝土學（土木406-112）&rdquo;，科技圖書公司。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3. C. K. Wang etc., &rdquo; Reinforced Concrete Design&rdquo;, 7th edition, 新月圖書公司。</div>\n</div>\n",
